{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101830","id":2799155907,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6m17rD","number":101830,"title":"Circular references in GDScript code may lead to leaks, UB and segmentation faults","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-01-20T12:36:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-13T21:12:41Z","closed_at":"2026-03-13T20:24:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nCurrent master (discovered during https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694 / https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619).\n\n### System information\n\nAll systems are affected.\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe GDScript parser has circular ownership (cyclic references). Through it, objects (at least `CowData`, potentially more) are accessed that are in the midst of destructing themselves. This may lead to leaks, segmentation faults, and unexpected behavior (UB). \n\nThe cyclic reference should be sanitized, because it is partially relying on UB (accessing half destructed objects) and can lead to problems when attempting seemingly innocent refactors. I ran into it when working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619. I managed to avoid leaks in this particular PR by papering over the issue  - specifically improving robustness against misuse of `CowData` through https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100694.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe objects involved in the cyclic reference are logged [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/12435300159/job/34720869143).\n\nIt is difficult for me to identify the problematic code further because I am not familiar with the GDScript parsing code.\n\nIt may be possible to identify what code accesses `CowData` while it is destructing by storing in it a boolean `is_destructing`, and if it is accessed while the boolean is true, it shall log the stack trace.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101830/timeline","performed_via_github_app":nu